  "facts": [
    "The swept-back petals make flowers look like tiny shuttlecocks or butterflies.",
    "Its tuber can live and flower for decades.",
    "Seed stalks coil like springs to pull pods down to the soil.",
    "Ants disperse cyclamen seeds, attracted by a sugary coating.",
    "It prefers cool rooms; warmth shortens bloom time dramatically."
